1
00:00:00,993 --> 00:00:03,023
(Sheldon:)because I never went through
a rebellious phase,

2
00:00:03,029 --> 00:00:05,459
(Sheldon:)so, I got an earring.

3
00:00:08,668 --> 00:00:11,198
(Sheldon:)My mother made me
take it out.

4
00:00:13,906 --> 00:00:16,576
(Sheldon:)Amy put alcohol on it.

5
00:00:19,278 --> 00:00:22,718
(Sheldon:)And here we are.

6
00:00:22,715 --> 00:00:24,045
(Howard:)What did we miss?

7
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:26,780
(Bernadette:)I couldn't explain it
if I tried.

8
00:00:35,145 --> 00:00:38,715
(Penny:)So tell me, how did Sheldon
look with an earring?

9
00:00:38,715 --> 00:00:40,445
(Amy:)Like the pirate who helps
the other pirates

10
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:44,050
(Amy:)connect to the Internet.

11
00:00:44,788 --> 00:00:46,158
(Howard:)So what did you
and Leonard do?

12
00:00:46,156 --> 00:00:48,626
(Penny:)Actually, we got in
a pretty nasty fight.

13
00:00:48,625 --> 00:00:50,425
(Leonard:)It might've been
the worst one we've ever had.

14
00:00:50,427 --> 00:00:51,457
(Raj:)Oh, my God,
what happened?

15
00:00:51,461 --> 00:00:53,091
(Leonard:)Well, we had started

16
00:00:53,096 --> 00:00:55,296
(Leonard:)binge-watching
Luke Cage together,

17
00:00:55,299 --> 00:00:57,629
(Leonard:)and it was kind of
our thing, and then,

18
00:00:57,634 --> 00:01:01,734
(Leonard:)I find out that she watched
two episodes without me.

